e tool reports   |\n   791\t|       |        | **prevalidation before any write** in `acopy` on JS and Dart (a behaviour      | no require of it; a tool failure is distinct from \"none found\".   |\n   792\t|       |        | change, §2.4); the M-entry callers of §2.4 are audited for the freeze rule.    | **Host-library gate (§8.2), built in this slice** as the library  |\n   793\t|       |        | Then `yin.vm.integer.host` deleted; the shim mention in `integer.cljc:14`      | mode of `dao.host.gate-test`: within the adopted closure, no      |\n   794\t|       |        | reworded. Deliverable: the library mode of `dao.host.gate-test` with the H2    | executable reference to `BigInteger`, `BigDecimal`,               |\n   795\t|       |        | name list (§8.2).                                                              | `clojure.lang.Ratio`, `java.text`, `unorm` outside `dao/host/`;   |\n   796\t|       |        |                                                                                | two negative tests: a fixture closure file holding an executable  |\n   797\t|       |        |                                                                                | `BigInteger` reference outside the allowlist fails the gate, and  |\n   798\t|       |        |                                                                                | a fixture file naming `BigInteger` only in a docstring and a      |\n   799\t|       |        |                                                                                | keyword passes. `yin.vm.engine` is touched (its require) and      |\n   800\t|       |        |                                                                                | pinned by the engine suites. List 1 shrinks by the migrated files |\n   801\t|       |        |                                                                                | (§8.1).                                                           |\n   802\t+-------+--------+-----